  "reason": "The study reports on the efficacy of PARG inhibition in preclinical models (organoids, xenografts, syngeneic mice) and analyzes human patient samples for expression levels and prognosis. However, it does not report a quantitative measure of agreement or concordance between animal model results and human clinical results. The focus is on the mechanism of action and therapeutic potential in preclinical settings, not on validating the predictive accuracy of the animal models against human outcomes."
